    "en": {
      "trackName": "Momo Math",
      "description": "Momo Math is for getting fast at the math you already know. It’s not a course or a tutor. It’s quick drilling: pick a topic, start a 60-second round and answer as many questions as you can.\n\nBeat your best, earn medals and level up Momo.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN DRILL\n\nBasics: add, subtract, multiply and divide\nNumber sense: factors, multiples, squares and primes\nFractions: simplify and find common denominators\nPercents and ratios\nUnits: metric and US conversions like cm to m, oz and lb\nShapes: polygon names and sides, 3D solids, and area, perimeter and volume\n\nEvery topic has Easy, Medium and Hard, and Add and Subtract have a Starter level too.\n\nDAILY CHALLENGE\nOne set of questions a day, one try, the same for everyone. Build a streak, and review anything you missed afterward.\n\nFOR WHEN YOU’RE STUCK\nMomo Math won’t teach you from scratch, but if a method slips your mind, every topic has a short refresher with a worked example and a few mental tricks. There are also charts to look at: the times table, a prime list, unit conversions and shape formulas.\n\nMIX IT UP\nEvery group has its own mix, plus a mix of everything.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\nEarn medals from Bronze to Platinum and unlock new colors, faces and rings for Momo as you level up.\n\nON EVERY DEVICE\nWorks on iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch, including the daily challenge. Your progress syncs through iCloud.",
      "releaseNotes": "Daily challenge on Apple Watch, new Units and Shapes sections, primes, and a times table chart. Perimeter, area and volume now drill the formulas with pictures. Tap the chart button in a round to peek at the answers’ charts. Plus a calculator-style number pad and a fix for negative answers.",
